          <li><strong>Monotonic Lower Bounds &amp; §4.5 Face Pruning:</strong> Whenever a composite objective is bounded below by partial prefixes ($e_1(r_1) \le E(r_1,r_2,r_3,r_4)$), exact branch-and-bound prunes 99.99%+ of an exponential space while certifying the true global optimum—eliminating both brute force and heuristic hallucination.</li>
